1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,640
你們等一下
Hey, you guys.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:05,100
我打包了一些碗碟給你們在新房子用
I packed up some dishes for the new house.

3
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:06,720
我甚至還找到了你的舊鴨嘴杯
I even found your old sippy cup

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,100
給小不點出生以后用
for when the little one comes along.

5
00:00:08,196 --> 00:00:09,286
-真好 -謝謝 鄧菲先生
- Aww. - Thanks, Mr. D.

6
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,060
謝謝爸爸
Thanks, Dad.

7
00:00:10,206 --> 00:00:12,726
媽媽還是黑著臉嗎
Is, uh, Mom still in there making that judgy face?

8
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,420
海莉 你都認識她二十五年了
Haley, you've known her for 25 years.

9
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,700
黑臉是她的預設表情
Just call it her face.

10
00:00:16,065 --> 00:00:18,245
海莉的懷孕初期并不順利
Haley's pregnancy is off to a rough start.

11
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,900
惡心反胃 情緒無常 失眠...
Nausea, moodiness, trouble sleeping...

12
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:21,800
這些癥狀克萊爾都有
Claire's got it all.

13
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:24,580
至于我 我只想保持
Me, I'm just trying to keep the peace

14
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:25,660
激素水平穩定
here in Hormone Town.

15
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,240
你能相信嗎 克萊爾
Oh, can you believe it, Claire?

16
00:00:28,455 --> 00:00:29,624
我們的小女孩長大了
Our little girl is growing up.

17
00:00:29,624 --> 00:00:30,744
是啊 她被逮捕并被大學開除后
Yeah, it seems like just yesterday

18
00:00:30,744 --> 00:00:32,554
我們把這些箱子搬到樓下
we were carrying all these boxes downstairs

19
00:00:32,554 --> 00:00:34,844
仿佛就發生在昨天
after she got arrested and kicked out of college.

20
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,780
是啊 我也經歷了很多
Yeah, I've been through a lot, too.

21
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,340
我當過加長禮車司機 當過主唱
I've been a limo driver, a lead singer,

22
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:41,600
當過牧場工人 還有迪士尼樂園的唱歌紳士
a ranch hand, a Dapper Dan at Disneyland,

23
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,860
T恤設計師 標志牌旋舞者
a t-shirt designer, a sign spinner

24
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:46,020
現在是個即將迎來小寶寶的護理專業學生
and now a nursing student with a baby on the way.

25
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,240
一切都按計劃進行
It's all going according to plan.

26
00:00:48,483 --> 00:00:51,213
所以我們想拿點東西過去
Oh. So, we're gonna take some stuff over.

27
00:00:51,213 --> 00:00:52,883
等下等下等下 我們來
Wait, wait, wait, wait. Let's get a, uh --

28
00:00:52,883 --> 00:00:54,633
我們來拍個母女合照
Let's get a mother/daughter picture.

29
00:00:54,633 --> 00:00:55,463
親愛的 我不
Oh... Oh, honey, I don't --

30
00:00:55,463 --> 00:00:56,723
我們 我們真的沒必要這樣
we -- we really don't have to.

31
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:57,840
別啊 會很棒的
No, no, no. It'll be cute.

32
00:00:58,083 --> 00:00:59,953
爸爸 你太奇怪了 沒人想要這樣
Uh, Dad, you're being weird. No one wants this.

33
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:00,780
保持姿勢
Hang on here.

34
00:01:00,913 --> 00:01:02,273
不對 這是我的指頭
Nope, that's my finger.

35
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,140
有好多有趣的濾鏡
So many fun filters.

36
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,580
趕緊拍吧
Just take the picture!

37
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,480
克萊爾 想得陽光一些
Claire, look at the positive.

38
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:22,300
我們的孩子之一終于搬走了
One of our kids is finally moving out.

39
00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:24,980
她驗孕之后我就再也不想聽到"陽"字了
After her pregnancy test, I've had enough positives.

40
00:01:25,271 --> 00:01:27,271
有點提醒我另外兩個孩子還沒有結婚生子
Kind of reminds me of two other unmarried, pregnant,

41
00:01:27,271 --> 00:01:29,461
上次看到熱戀情侶搬到一起是在...
lovestruck kids who moved in together about...

42
00:01:29,461 --> 00:01:31,021
大概二十五年前吧
25 years ago.

43
00:01:31,021 --> 00:01:32,021
那不一樣
It's not the same.

44
00:01:32,021 --> 00:01:33,470
是嗎 酸洗他們的牛仔褲
I don't know. Acid-wash their jeans

45
00:01:33,470 --> 00:01:35,320
再往迪蘭的耳朵上掛捕夢網
and put a dream catcher in Dylan's ear,

46
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,580
就簡直是翻版了
and it's exactly the same.

47
00:01:36,620 --> 00:01:37,940
親愛的 我昨晚做了個夢
Honey, I had a dream last night

48
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:39,720
他們把寶寶忘在出租車上
that they left the baby in an Uber,

49
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,760
我不得不縮小自己
and I had to shrink myself down

50
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:43,720
征用一只蜂鳥去找寶寶
to commandeer a hummingbird to find it.

51
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:46,040
不是你又跟知名主播的春夢我就很慶幸了
I'm just glad it wasn't another Jake Tapper sex dream.

52
00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:48,800
我很焦慮 我害怕他們能力不足...
I'm mad. I'm scared they're in over their heads --

53
00:01:48,820 --> 00:01:50,820
克萊爾 已經發生了 他們要有寶寶了
Claire, it's happening. They're having the baby.

54
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,680
列車都離站了 你就上車吧
The train's left the station. Get on board.

55
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:53,900
行吧
Fine.

56
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:55,060
你說得對
You're right.

57
00:01:55,699 --> 00:01:57,969
你是對的 我 我會試著積極一點的
You're right. I'll -- I'll try to be positive.

58
00:01:57,969 --> 00:02:00,369
好極了 我正準備為他們挑件喬遷賀禮
Good. I was gonna go pick up a house-warming gift for them.

59
00:02:00,369 --> 00:02:02,539
-和我一起吧 -行 走吧
- Why don't you come with me? - Oh, okay, let's do that.

60
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,240
等一下 你要怎么登上一輛
Wait a second. How do you board a train

61
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,640
已經離站的列車
that's already left the station?

62
00:02:07,088 --> 00:02:08,718
不知道 也許你可以和那個主播一起
I don't know. Maybe you could catch up to them

63
00:02:08,718 --> 00:02:10,598
乘著蜂鳥趕上他們
on a hummingbird with Jake Tapper.

64
00:02:12,100 --> 00:02:13,380
你脫身了
Well, you're off the hook.

65
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:14,940
我要獨自飛往布蘭森
I'm flying to Branson solo,

66
00:02:14,940 --> 00:02:17,060
我想我會坐在一個陌生人身旁
and I guess I'll be sitting next to a stranger

67
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:19,360
參加《奧斯蒙兄弟:向嘻哈致敬》
at The Osmond Brothers: A Tribute to Hip Hop.

68
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:21,400
他們來康普頓的時候我會抓住機會的
Well, I'll catch them when they come to Compton,

69
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,380
不過還是謝了
but thank you.

70
00:02:22,820 --> 00:02:23,980
你為我姐姐小帕做了那么多
Well, it's the least I could do

71
00:02:23,980 --> 00:02:25,700
這是我唯一能做的
after what you did for my sister, Pam.

72
00:02:26,247 --> 00:02:28,657
我姐姐 小帕 要來接卡爾去...
My sister, Pam, is coming to pick up Cal to --

73
00:02:28,657 --> 00:02:29,967
回到密蘇里
to take him back to Missouri.

74
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,460
她本來應該在監獄里再待三個月的
She was supposed to be in prison another three months,

75
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:34,640
但我了不起的丈夫
but my wonderful husband,

76
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:37,280
普里契特地檢官助理 寫了一封信
Assistant D.A. Pritchett, wrote a letter

77
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:39,200
呼吁提早釋放她
advocating for her early release.

78
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,340
這沒什么
It was nothing.

79
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:42,500
其實真的沒什么
It actually was nothing.

80
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:43,720
我從來沒寫過什么信
I never wrote any letter.

81
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,900
因為... 感覺就是不對的
It just -- It didn't feel right.

82
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:49,240
小帕毫無悔改之意 她的判決也很公正
Pam showed no remorse, and her sentence was fair.

83
00:02:49,326 --> 00:02:50,786
然后出于某種原因
And -- And then for some reason,

84
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:53,080
但不管怎樣 他們決定讓她早點出獄
they decided to let her out early anyway.

85
00:02:53,345 --> 00:02:56,135
很幸運 假釋記錄是密封的
Fortunately, uh, parole records are sealed,

86
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:57,900
所以小帕和小卡永遠也不會知道
so Pam and Cam will never know,

87
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:59,560
我也不用去布蘭森了
and I don't have to go to Branson

88
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,660
聽奧斯蒙兄弟叫觀眾喊個"啥啥"
and hear the Osmonds ask if they can get a "What-what."

89
00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:03,400
是她
That's her!

90
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,640
卡爾 你媽媽來啦
Cal, that's your mom!

91
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:07,480
她剛結束了... 旅行
She's back from her, um...trip?

92
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:08,720
鐵窗之旅
Up the river.

93
00:03:10,474 --> 00:03:12,494
小帕 她來啦
Pam! There she is!

94
00:03:12,494 --> 00:03:15,254
-你們好啊 -見到你太高興了
- Hey, y'all! - Oh, it's so good to see you!

95
00:03:15,254 --> 00:03:16,833
-嗨 -嗨 媽媽
- Hi! - Hi. Momma!

96
00:03:16,854 --> 00:03:19,554
是我的小炸雞塊啊
There's my little chicken nugget!

97
00:03:19,554 --> 00:03:21,774
我的老天
Ooh, my goodness!

98
00:03:21,774 --> 00:03:24,933
我太想你了 你過得怎么樣
I missed you so much. How have you been?

99
00:03:24,933 --> 00:03:26,383
他們每天晚上都給我讀故事
They read to me every night.

100
00:03:26,383 --> 00:03:28,193
別擔心 寶寶
Aw, don't worry, baby.

101
00:03:28,193 --> 00:03:29,963
不用再受那種折磨了
That's all over now.

102
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:31,820
差點忘了
Oh, almost forgot!

103
00:03:32,183 --> 00:03:33,583
看看媽媽為你做了什么
Look what Momma made you.

104
00:03:33,583 --> 00:03:35,163
我要把它放在我的自行車上
I'm gonna put it on my bike!

105
00:03:35,163 --> 00:03:37,733
他要安在自己的自行車上
Oh, he's gonna put it on his bike!

106
00:03:37,733 --> 00:03:40,202
小帕 真高興你出獄了
Oh, Pam, it is so great that you're out.

107
00:03:40,202 --> 00:03:41,872
里面一定很孤單
It must've been so lonely in there.

108
00:03:41,872 --> 00:03:44,692
還是有人陪的
Well, there was some companionship.

109
00:03:44,692 --> 00:03:45,612
真好
Good.

110
00:03:45,612 --> 00:03:47,722
-我嘗試了女同性戀 -好吧
- I dabbled in lesbianism. - Oh.

111
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,720
并不反感
Didn't hate it.

112
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:50,840
就是事后話太多
But there was just too much talking afterwards.

113
00:03:51,102 --> 00:03:53,352
-好了 我去給你倒點冰茶 -好的
- Yeah, yeah, I'm gonna get you some iced tea. - Yeah.

114
00:03:53,352 --> 00:03:56,131
還有 很抱歉你不能住在樓上
Again, I'm -- I'm so sorry that you can't stay upstairs.

115
00:03:56,131 --> 00:03:58,421
-我們有新的租客要搬進來 -閉嘴吧
- We have this new renter coming in, and - Cram it.

116
00:03:58,460 --> 00:03:59,920
我知道你根本沒寄那封信
I know you didn't send that letter.

117
00:04:00,111 --> 00:04:01,161
什么 你怎么知道
What? H-How?

118
00:04:01,161 --> 00:04:02,121
我怎么知道不重要
That don't matter.

119
00:04:02,121 --> 00:04:04,131
重要的是你會付出代價的
All that matters is you're gonna pay.

120
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:07,100
在監獄里大家叫我肉毒桿菌
In prison, they called me BOTOX,

121
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:09,340
因為雖然所有女人都想要我[美容用]
because even though all the ladies want me,

122
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,360
我還是會弄爛你的臉
I will wreck your face.

123
00:04:15,890 --> 00:04:17,670
雪莉 我不確定自己喜歡這身打扮
Sherry, I-I don't know if I like these.

124
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,600
褲子太短了
They're so short.

125
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,880
不啊 就是這種風格 寶貝
No, that's the style, boo.

126
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:22,000
我就是覺得自己的腳踝不太適合穿這個
I just don't know if I have the ankles for this.

127
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:24,380
對 這種褲子對拉丁人一點都不友好
Yeah, those pants are no good for Latin people.

128
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:26,760
穿上去像是要跑著趟水過河
They make you look like you're trying to run across a river.

129
00:04:27,060 --> 00:04:28,380
我倒覺得你看起來很不錯
Well, I think you look great.

130
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:30,860
你應該以后只穿這種褲子
You should only wear pants like that from now on.

131
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:31,660
好的
Okay.

132
00:04:33,299 --> 00:04:35,559
曼尼 我們該開始為你的生日派對
Manny, we should start sending invitations

133
00:04:35,559 --> 00:04:37,359
寄邀請函了
for your birthday party.

134
00:04:37,359 --> 00:04:38,789
是嗎 我以為我們要去
Oh, but I thought we were gonna go to

135
00:04:38,789 --> 00:04:41,688
奧海鎮啞劇品酒節慶祝你的生日
the Ojai Mime and Wine Festival for your birthday?

136
00:04:41,688 --> 00:04:44,648
對 我們還是不要辦派對了 媽
Oh, yeah, maybe we shouldn't do the party, Mom.

137
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:45,880
這太瘋狂了
This is crazy.

138
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,100
曼尼害怕啞劇
Manny's terrified of mimes.

139
00:04:48,220 --> 00:04:50,300
而且他討厭中央山谷的葡萄酒
And he hates Central Valley wine.

140
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:52,760
好消息
Hey, great news.

141
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:55,140
我的當月香腸早到了一天
My Sausage of the Month arrived a day early.

142
00:04:55,668 --> 00:04:57,607
你一定要在這見證開箱
You get to be here for the un-boxing.

143
00:04:57,607 --> 00:04:59,037
這次我不錄像了
I'm not gonna film it this time.

144
00:04:59,037 --> 00:05:00,597
波蘭熏腸 太好了
Kielbasa, yes!

145
00:05:00,597 --> 00:05:02,187
他們又聽取了我的建議
They took my suggestion again.

146
00:05:02,187 --> 00:05:03,937
我跟你說過那不是建議
I told you it's not a suggestion.

147
00:05:03,937 --> 00:05:06,387
網頁上是讓你選一種口味
The web page is just asking you to choose one.

148
00:05:06,460 --> 00:05:07,680
總之 我們有麻煩了
Anyways, we have a problem.

149
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,520
雪莉總是對曼尼發號施令
Sherry is bossing Manny around.

150
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,720
這太讓人難以接受了
Oof, that's a lot to take in.

151
00:05:12,420 --> 00:05:14,980
你能用你的獨家醬料做一下香腸嗎
Can you cook these up with that special sauce you do?

152
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,100
你得去告訴他
You have to go and tell him

153
00:05:16,100 --> 00:05:18,660
-他要站起來為自己說話 -為什么我去
- that he needs to stand up for himself. - Why me?

154
00:05:18,776 --> 00:05:20,926
我覺得我們壓根就不應該干涉 但是
I-I don't think we should get involved at all, but, I mean,

155
00:05:20,926 --> 00:05:23,396
如果你覺得有問題 那應該你去說
if it's a problem for you, then you do it,

156
00:05:23,396 --> 00:05:24,426
因為我不在乎
'cause I don't care.

157
00:05:24,426 --> 00:05:25,166
我不能去
I can't.

158
00:05:25,166 --> 00:05:26,916
如果是我說曼尼女朋友的壞話
If I say something bad about Manny's girlfriend,

159
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,920
他是不會聽的 因為那樣我就成了
he's not gonna listen, because I am the mother

160
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:31,560
認為沒人配得上她小寶貝的那種媽媽
who thinks that nobody's good enough for her little boy.

161
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:34,100
-那就別插手了 -不行 因為她就是
- Just let it go. - I can't because she's not good enough

162
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:34,880
配不上我的小寶貝
for my little boy.

163
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:36,480
我還是不了
I'm gonna take a pass.

164
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:39,480
那我也不用我外婆的洋蔥辣醬
Then I'm gonna take a pass making your sausages

165
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,800
給你做香腸
with my grandmother's spicy onion sauce.

166
00:05:41,915 --> 00:05:43,285
好吧 我去
Fine, I'll do it.

167
00:05:43,285 --> 00:05:46,594
說好的原配才會要求一大堆呢
But all these demands don't sound very second wife-y.

168
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:50,260
孩子
Hey, kid.

169
00:05:50,980 --> 00:05:53,520
我得跟你聊聊你和你女朋友
I need to talk to you about you and your girlfriend.

170
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,900
這話題可能有點敏感
It's a sensitive subject.

171
00:05:56,164 --> 00:05:58,254
如果你想說昨天晚上從我房間傳出來的聲音
If this is about the sounds coming from my room last night,

172
00:05:58,260 --> 00:05:59,200
那不是你想的那樣
it wasn't what you think.

173
00:05:59,420 --> 00:06:00,860
我們是在重新布置家具
We were rearranging the furniture, and then

174
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:02,720
然后為成功改造而慶功
we were congratulating each other on how it turned out.

175
00:06:02,860 --> 00:06:03,980
令人難過的是 我真的信你
Sadly, I believe you.

176
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:06,880
我以為你喜歡家具保持原樣
I thought you liked your furniture exactly like it was?

177
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:09,060
我們還因為這開除了兩個清潔女工
We fired two cleaning women over this.

178
00:06:09,460 --> 00:06:11,060
我之前也以為 但是其實不是的
I thought I did, too, but it turns out I didn't.

179
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:12,960
其實我不想聊的正是這件事
Actually, that's what I don't want to talk to you about.

180
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:15,300
有沒有可能雪莉總是對你發號施令
Is it possible Sherry pushes you around?

181
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:16,460
你什么意思
What are you saying?

182
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,400
我不知道
I don't know.

183
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,080
就是男人一點
Be the man, you know.

184
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,460
有點骨氣
Show some backbone.

185
00:06:21,932 --> 00:06:24,382
-這么說簡直太有你的風格了 -才沒有
- That is such a you thing to say. - It really isn't.

186
00:06:24,382 --> 00:06:26,472
這樣看待男女關系太老套了
It's such an old way of looking at relationships.

187
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,720
性別角色不再重要了
Gender roles don't matter anymore.

188
00:06:27,780 --> 00:06:29,040
這就是你穿她褲子的原因嗎
Is that why you're wearing her pants?

189
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,480
我來跟你講講 杰
Let me tell you something, Jay.

190
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,620
就像長腿褲
Just like long pants,

191
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:33,300
荼毒人心的男子氣概那一套已經落伍了
toxic machismo has gone out of style.

192
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:35,980
對對 你說的都對 男子氣概不好
Yeah. Yeah, masculinity's bad

193
00:06:36,161 --> 00:06:38,091
但等需要男子氣概打死蜘蛛時就知道了
till someone has to kill a spider.

194
00:06:45,711 --> 00:06:48,100
歡迎來到弗萊徹大街14 7/8號
Welcome to 14 7/8 Fletcher Ave.

195
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:50,210
真溫馨 是吧
Wow. This is cozy, huh?

196
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,820
這是車庫改裝的
Well, it's a converted garage,

197
00:06:51,820 --> 00:06:53,040
所以是有點小
so I know it's a little bit small.

198
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,240
親愛的 只有用來住人才算小
Oh, honey, it's only small for a place to live.

199
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:57,030
我們給你們帶了個暖家禮物
Hey, we got you guys a housewarming gift.

200
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:58,620
是個菠蘿裝飾
It's a decorative pineapple

201
00:06:58,750 --> 00:07:01,350
因為 菠蘿象征好運旺旺來
because, uh, pineapples are a symbol of good luck.

202
00:07:01,350 --> 00:07:02,310
謝謝 鄧菲先生
Thanks, Mr. D.

203
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:04,319
這可比我們的大櫻桃好多了
That's way better than our giant cherry.

204
00:07:04,540 --> 00:07:05,980
這是干凈馬桶的象征
That's just a symbol of a clean toilet.

205
00:07:06,460 --> 00:07:06,760
謝謝老爸
Thanks, Dad.

206
00:07:06,899 --> 00:07:07,599
不用客氣
You've very welcome.

207
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:10,400
這其實是我們倆一起的心意 對吧親愛的
It's actually from both of us, right, honey?

208
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:12,820
對對 因為我覺得
Right. Right, because I thought

209
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:13,980
你會需要很多好運
you would want a lot of luck.

210
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:15,880
媽媽 我知道你有何想法
Mom, look. I know what you're thinking...

211
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:17,560
但我們能省很多錢
...but we're saving a ton of money.

212
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,120
房租包水電費
Utilities are included,

213
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,820
我們不需要很多家具
we don't need a lot of furniture,

214
00:07:20,868 --> 00:07:23,338
而且以后也不怕找不到寶寶了
and it'll be easy to keep track of the baby!

215
00:07:23,338 --> 00:07:26,688
他們 他們還能步行到機場
And they can, uh -- they can walk to the airport.

216
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:29,900
然后又回到客廳
Which brings us back to the living room.

217
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,820
厲害 我們不用走動就看完你家了呢
Wow. We got the whole tour without even moving.

218
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,800
這年頭就流行小房子
Tiny-homes are very trendy these days.

219
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,460
對了 我也是這么
And, by the way, it's what I called

220
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:38,300
稱呼我高中的黑人矮子死黨
my short, black best friend in high school.

221
00:07:38,807 --> 00:07:41,317
你們打算把嬰兒床放在哪
So, where -- where are you thinking of putting the baby's crib?

222
00:07:41,317 --> 00:07:43,717
就放在這個天窗下面
We were thinking about putting it right there under the skylight.

223
00:07:43,717 --> 00:07:46,327
這樣寶寶抬頭就能伸手摘天上的星星
That way, the baby can look up and reach for the stars.

224
00:07:46,897 --> 00:07:48,077
我好喜歡這樣
Ohh, I love that.

225
00:07:48,077 --> 00:07:50,236
而且你們看 那塊玻璃多干凈啊
And look how clean that glass is.

226
00:07:50,236 --> 00:07:51,956
"干凈"得離奇了吧
A little too clean.

227
00:07:53,346 --> 00:07:54,576
這不是天窗
It's -- It's not a skylight.

228
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:55,680
是你屋頂上有個洞
There's a hole in your roof.

229
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:58,140
真好 我一直想學如何安裝天窗
Cool, I always wanted to learn how to install a skylight.

230
00:07:58,140 --> 00:07:59,640
擇日不如撞日了
I guess today's the day.

231
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:02,000
那你有沒有過把浴室里的插座
Have you also always wanted to move an electrical outlet

232
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,080
移到別處的想法呢
that's currently in the shower?

233
00:08:03,376 --> 00:08:04,876
-這應該不是暗語吧 -不是的
- Well, that can't be code. - It's not.

234
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,340
我就是在說真實情況
I'm telling you exactly what's going on.

235
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,760
抱歉 我接個電話
Oh, excuse me.

236
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:11,460
海莉 乖女兒
Haley, honey.

237
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:13,560
你無法在這里養育寶寶
You can't raise a baby in here.

238
00:08:13,895 --> 00:08:15,585
要是寶寶在哭
What happens if -- if the baby's crying

239
00:08:15,585 --> 00:08:17,405
-但你要睡覺 怎么辦 -我想過了
- and you need to sleep? - Thought of it.

240
00:08:17,405 --> 00:08:19,505
我們會掛起一張床單 隔出一個小房間
We're gonna put up a sheet to make it like a little room.

241
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,120
好機智
Oh, smart.

242
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,480
告訴我這哪里有用了
Tell me how this works.

243
00:08:22,684 --> 00:08:25,744
哇哇哇 你能聽見我哭嗎
Wahh, wahh, wahh. Could you hear me?

244
00:08:25,744 --> 00:08:27,994
我知道這里不理想 但我們沒問題的
I know it's not perfect, but we've got this.

245
00:08:27,994 --> 00:08:29,694
我們比你想的要成熟多了
We're a lot more grown up than you think.

246
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,540
海莉 你能來廚房跟我談談嗎
Haley, can I talk to you for a second in the kitchen?

247
00:08:31,734 --> 00:08:32,585
好
Yeah.

248
00:08:33,954 --> 00:08:34,894
是醫生打來
Uh, that was the doctor.

249
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:36,200
我們這會兒應該到那里的
We're supposed to be there right now.

250
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:38,540
老天 超聲波 我忘得一干二凈了
Oh, my God. The ultrasound -- I totally spaced!

251
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:40,120
千萬不能讓我媽知道
We can't let my mom find out.

252
00:08:40,523 --> 00:08:43,023
我們想個靠譜的借口 然后出門
Um, let's just make up something responsible and get out of here.

253
00:08:43,023 --> 00:08:44,054
-好的 -好咧
- Okay. - Okay.

254
00:08:44,753 --> 00:08:47,923
我們要出門買牙刷
So, we need to go and get toothbrushes.

255
00:08:47,923 --> 00:08:49,333
你應該掛起床單的
You should've put up a sheet.

256
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,360
我們都聽見了
We heard everything.

257
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:52,680
你錯過了第一次超聲波預約嗎
You missed your first ultrasound appointment?

258
00:08:52,700 --> 00:08:54,500
你再繼續教訓我 就真趕不上了
Well, we will if you keep lecturing me.

259
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:56,140
-醫生是誰 -我們從點評網上找到的
- Who's the doctor? - We found her on Yelp.

260
00:08:56,140 --> 00:08:57,380
她有四星好評呢
She has, like, four stars.

261
00:08:57,642 --> 00:08:59,702
害盧克肚子里長蟲那家壽司餐廳也有四星好評
So does the sushi place that gave Luke worms.

262
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:00,500
我跟你一起去
I'm coming with you.

263
00:09:00,740 --> 00:09:01,720
那我就留在這
I think I'm just gonna hang back

264
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,560
完成安裝天窗的任務吧
and commence Operation Skylight.

265
00:09:03,860 --> 00:09:06,260
我車停在后面了 我們從這邊走
I parked in back. Let's go this way.

266
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:07,560
老天
Oh, God!

267
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:11,380
真幸運 我們剛買了掃把
That is lucky! We just bought a broom.

268
00:09:12,611 --> 00:09:14,931
這不是我最喜歡的大姑嘛
Hey, there's my favorite sister-in-law.

269
00:09:14,931 --> 00:09:16,841
我給你買了根冰棒
I, uh -- I got you a Popsicle,

270
00:09:16,951 --> 00:09:18,491
棍子上有個冷笑話
and the stick has a joke on it.

271
00:09:18,491 --> 00:09:20,821
"如何修好壞掉的大猩猩"
Um, "How do you fix a broken gorilla?"

272
00:09:20,821 --> 00:09:22,961
我想很快就知道答案了
Mm, well, I guess we're gonna find out soon.

273
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,820
棍子不止能用來寫冷笑話
Sticks are good for more than joking.

274
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,420
我在監獄里學會了如何把
In prison, I learned how to fashion

275
00:09:26,420 --> 00:09:28,060
各式各樣的棍子磨成小刀
all manner of sticks into knives.

276
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:30,820
你在牢里還有時間做手工 好棒呀
You know, I love that you had time for crafts in there.

277
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:33,380
我還學會了 如果你不兌現自己所做的承諾
I also learned if you don't do what you say you're gonna,

278
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:34,460
就會被教訓
you get hurt.

279
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,210
我去看看小卡爾
Um, I'm gonna go, uh, check on Cal.

280
00:09:37,210 --> 00:09:38,040
不不不 我去吧
No, no, no, I'll do it.

281
00:09:38,180 --> 00:09:40,280
我想在你帶他回家前
I want to soak up as much time with him as I can

282
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,440
盡量多跟他在一起
before you take him home.

283
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:42,220
小卡爾
Cal.

284
00:09:42,769 --> 00:09:44,559
小卡爾 那是什么 快放下
Cal, what is -- Put that down!

285
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:45,960
他從哪弄來的芝士漢堡
Where did he get a cheeseburger?

286
00:09:46,100 --> 00:09:47,120
我不知道
I don't know.

287
00:09:48,999 --> 00:09:51,019
聽我說 信的事我很抱歉
Hey, look. I'm -- I-I'm sorry about the letter,

288
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,580
但結果不是很好嗎
but it all worked out.

289
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:54,600
你還是提前獲釋了
You still got out early.

290
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:58,620
那僅僅是因為我自愿幫忙訓練警犬
Only because I volunteered to help train police dogs.

291
00:09:59,618 --> 00:10:01,068
那經歷太可怕了
It was horrible.

292
00:10:02,018 --> 00:10:04,028
我要偷電視機啦
I'm stealing a TV!

293
00:10:04,028 --> 00:10:06,278
我要偷電視機啦
I'm stealing a TV!

294
00:10:07,128 --> 00:10:08,418
放開我
Get off of me!

295
00:10:08,558 --> 00:10:10,298
怎么還會痛
I feel it!

296
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:11,760
你到底想要我怎么樣
What do you want from me?

297
00:10:11,847 --> 00:10:13,577
-把里程給我 -什么
- Miles. - Uh, what?

298
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:16,240
我知道你們有錢人的信用卡積分能兌換里程
I know all you fancy people have rewards cards.

299
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:18,780
被關了那么久 我很想去旅行
Being all cooped up has given me the travel bug.

300
00:10:18,927 --> 00:10:19,897
但我存了很久呢
But I've been saving those.

301
00:10:19,900 --> 00:10:22,080
我有半年都去加油站買日用品
I bought groceries at a gas station for six months

302
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:22,900
就為了得到三倍積分
to get triple points.

303
00:10:23,107 --> 00:10:24,507
我們給莉莉準備的生日早餐
For -- For Lily's birthday breakfast,

304
00:10:24,507 --> 00:10:26,597
是山寨的夾心餅干
we gave her something called Pop Zarts.

305
00:10:26,860 --> 00:10:27,960
今天之內
I want them in my account

306
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,740
把里程轉到我賬戶 否則我就告訴小卡
by the end of the day or I tell Cameron.

307
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:32,820
但我差不多能兌換兩張去巴黎的非熱門時段機票了
But I almost have enough for two off-peak flights to Paris.

308
00:10:33,586 --> 00:10:35,286
"猴子扳手"[壞事精]
Ha, "Monkey wrench."

309
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,600
你還說得真輕巧
Yeah, that's putting it mildly.

310
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:40,120
不是 這是修好壞掉的大猩猩的方法 死蠢
No, that's how you fix a broken gorilla, you dummy.

311
00:10:44,265 --> 00:10:46,145
你在這呢 進行得如何
Oh, there you are. How did it go?

312
00:10:46,155 --> 00:10:47,206
不順利
Not well.

313
00:10:47,365 --> 00:10:49,425
他惱羞成怒 說我是老古董
He got all mad, called me old-fashioned.

314
00:10:49,425 --> 00:10:51,185
我 我可給艾麗克斯買了本
Me -- the guy who bought Alex a book

315
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:52,620
有關成功商業女士的書
on successful business ladies.

316
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,480
不好意思 我沒聽懂
Sorry, I didn't understand that.

317
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,420
請再說一遍
Please try again.

318
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:57,700
那個咖啡研磨機怎么老和我說話
Why does that coffee grinder keep talking to me?

319
00:10:57,860 --> 00:10:59,440
你信守諾言
Well, you kept your end of the bargain,

320
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:00,620
所以我會給你做香腸
so I'm gonna make the sausages,

321
00:11:00,620 --> 00:11:02,360
然后來討論下一步計劃吧
and we'll talk about the second step later.

322
00:11:02,380 --> 00:11:03,860
沒有下一步 我已經去說過了
There's no second steps. I did it.

323
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:05,360
我不想再聽到這件事了
That's the last I want to hear about it.

324
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:06,400
真是"謝謝"你啊 杰
Thanks a lot, Jay.

325
00:11:06,764 --> 00:11:07,824
我本應該忽視你的話
I should've ignored you,

326
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:08,960
但你的話影響了我
but you got in my head.

327
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:11,560
什么呀 我第一次聽到這事情呢
About what? This is first time I hear of this.

328
00:11:11,824 --> 00:11:13,984
我開始想或許她真的對我有點頤指氣使
I started thinking maybe she does boss me around

329
00:11:13,984 --> 00:11:16,913
所以我找她談了 談得有點過火
a little bit, so I confronted her, things got heated,

330
00:11:16,913 --> 00:11:19,043
現在她叫了車要走了
and now she called a car and she's leaving.

331
00:11:19,043 --> 00:11:20,293
我談過最棒的戀愛
The best relationship I've ever had,

332
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,480
估計要結束了
and I think it might be ending.

333
00:11:22,023 --> 00:11:23,673
最后一次聽你的話了 杰
Last time I listen to you, Jay.

334
00:11:23,673 --> 00:11:25,583
別擔心 寶貝 事情總會
Don't worry, papi. Those things have a way

335
00:11:25,583 --> 00:11:28,123
-迎刃而解的 -算了 這還能怎么做呢
- of working themselves out. - Eh, what're ya gonna do?

336
00:11:28,140 --> 00:11:30,200
是個好問題 你還能"怎么做"呢
Yeah, that's a good question. What are you going to do?

337
00:11:30,340 --> 00:11:31,480
這樣不好
I'm calling it.

338
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:32,400
我不來了
I'm done.

339
00:11:32,662 --> 00:11:34,002
正在給"布萊了""撥號"
Calling Brian Dunn.

340
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,420
別別別
No. No, no.

341
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:36,580
我欠他錢呢
I owe him money.

342
00:11:36,900 --> 00:11:38,120
杰 你得去跟雪莉談談
Jay, you need to talk to Sherry

343
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,600
和她說這都是你的餿主意
and tell her that it was your idea.

344
00:11:39,780 --> 00:11:41,300
我已經遵守約定了
I've kept up my part of the bargain.

345
00:11:41,432 --> 00:11:42,592
你別跟我來哥倫比亞人那套
Now, don't go all Colombian

346
00:11:42,592 --> 00:11:43,752
和我說如果我不和雪莉談
and tell me if I don't talk to Sherry

347
00:11:43,752 --> 00:11:44,992
你就不做香腸
you're not making those sausages,

348
00:11:44,992 --> 00:11:46,721
因為我已經吃了第二顆降膽固醇藥了
'cause I already took a second statin.

349
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:50,800
對不起 這次你得不到你想要的
Sorry, for once, you're not getting your way.

350
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:53,400
雪兒 有空嗎
Hey, Sher, got a sec?

351
00:11:53,601 --> 00:11:55,721
不好說 司機巴特弗還有兩分鐘就到了
Uh, tough to say. Bartev is two minutes away,

352
00:11:55,721 --> 00:11:57,301
但軟件顯示車在轉圈 所以...
but his car is spinning, so...

353
00:11:57,301 --> 00:11:58,691
我知道你在生曼尼的氣
I know you're upset with Manny.

354
00:11:58,691 --> 00:11:59,802
這都怪我
That's on me.

355
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:01,380
是我說了話影響了他的想法
I put some ideas in his head.

356
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,740
你知道 我對他來說就像個英雄
You know, I'm kind of a hero to him.

357
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,040
我沒想引起任何麻煩
I didn't mean to cause any trouble.

358
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:05,880
你知道 我很愛他
You know, I'm crazy about the kid,

359
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:07,980
我只是想確保他處于良好的戀愛關系之中
and I just want to make sure he's in a healthy relationship.

360
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,920
歌洛莉亞讓你這么做的 是不是
Gloria put you up to this, didn't she?

361
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,980
很復雜
It's complicated.

362
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:13,280
你看得出這有多諷刺吧
You do see the irony of this, right?

363
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,380
她擔心曼尼被人控制
She's so worried about Manny getting bossed around,

364
00:12:15,380 --> 00:12:17,140
但她對你這樣就沒問題啦
yet she has no problem bossing you around?

365
00:12:17,239 --> 00:12:19,449
-不不 不是這樣 -真的嗎
- No, no, that's crazy. - Really?

366
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:20,960
你本來是這么安排下午時光的嗎
Is this how you wanted to spend your afternoon?

367
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,220
不 我討厭這樣
No, I hate this.

368
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:23,620
我一整天都計劃好了
Man, I had a whole day planned.

369
00:12:24,100 --> 00:12:26,720
聽著 我打算讓曼尼著急幾個小時
Listen, I'm gonna let Manny spiral for a few hours,

370
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,900
然后我們就上樓
and then we're gonna go back upstairs

371
00:12:27,900 --> 00:12:28,820
"移家具"去
and move the furniture around.

372
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:29,800
天啊 居然真是"那檔事"
Oh, God, it was that.

373
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:31,340
但你需要為自己發聲
But you need to stand up for yourself.

374
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:33,180
你回去 告訴歌洛莉亞
You go back in there, and you tell Gloria

375
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:34,740
你受夠了對她唯唯諾諾
that you're tired of being told what to do.

376
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,520
-讓我想一下 -別想了
- Let me think about it. - Don't think.

377
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,720
-做就對了 -好
- Just do it. - Okay.

378
00:12:41,558 --> 00:12:43,068
天啊
Oh! Oh.

379
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,940
放輕松 你有的我都看過
Relax. It's nothing I haven't seen before.

380
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:47,840
我以前可是在男子摔跤隊
I was on the boys' wrestling team.

381
00:12:47,980 --> 00:12:49,740
你想要什么 我已經把里程給你了
What do you want? I transferred the miles.

382
00:12:49,937 --> 00:12:52,717
我收到了 我決定了我不想旅行 但...
I got 'em. Decided I don't want to travel, though --

383
00:12:52,900 --> 00:12:54,520
我把他們都換成禮品卡了
converted them all into gift cards.

384
00:12:54,660 --> 00:12:56,920
不不不 他們說你不應該這么做
No, no, no, they say you're not supposed to do that.

385
00:12:57,020 --> 00:12:59,020
我決定我想要點其他的
I decided I want something else.

386
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,740
我想搬到樓上
I want to move in upstairs,

387
00:13:00,857 --> 00:13:03,807
我還想要一個高效空氣過濾器
and I want a HEPA air filter on account of I shed.

388
00:13:03,807 --> 00:13:06,816
我跟你說過租出去了 我不能不讓人家來住
I told you it's rented. I can't just cancel on them.

389
00:13:06,980 --> 00:13:07,800
你確定嗎
You sure about that?

390
00:13:07,900 --> 00:13:09,200
因為我得不到我想要的
Because when I don't get what I want,

391
00:13:09,220 --> 00:13:11,340
我就能讓事情變得"很難受"
I can make things real uncomfortable.

392
00:13:12,226 --> 00:13:13,647
好冷 好冷
Oh, cold, cold!

393
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:14,560
怎么了
What's going on?

394
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:15,440
沒事
Nothing.

395
00:13:15,956 --> 00:13:17,276
米奇爾和我聊天呢
Mitchell and I's just talking.

396
00:13:17,276 --> 00:13:18,546
不不 我們沒 我不能
No, no, we weren't. I can't --

397
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:20,160
我不能再忍受了 對不起
I can't take this anymore. I'm sorry.

398
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:23,460
-我沒給假釋委員會寫信 -什么
- I never wrote the letter to the parole board. - What?

399
00:13:23,865 --> 00:13:26,165
我想撒謊 但我做不到
I -- I tried to lie, but I just -- I couldn't do it.

400
00:13:26,165 --> 00:13:28,265
但你對我撒謊卻沒問題啊
Yet you had no problem lying to me.

401
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:31,600
你就讓我姐姐待在可怕的監獄里受罪嗎
You just let my sister rot in that horrific hell hole?

402
00:13:31,975 --> 00:13:35,005
得了吧 他們每周二都能吃玉米卷
Oh, please, they have a Taco Tuesday!

403
00:13:36,564 --> 00:13:38,164
-小卡 我們能談下嗎 -等下
- Uh, Cam, c-can we talk? - Oh, hold up.

404
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,580
我在翻看一些
I'm just looking through some pictures of me

405
00:13:39,580 --> 00:13:40,400
我幫你家人忙的照片
helping out your family.

406
00:13:40,674 --> 00:13:42,734
這是我帶杰和歌洛莉亞去機場
Here I am taking Jay and Gloria to the airport,

407
00:13:42,734 --> 00:13:45,974
這是我幫艾麗克斯搬到大學宿舍
and, oh, this is me, uh, helping Alex move into her dorm room,

408
00:13:45,974 --> 00:13:48,454
誰能忘了菲爾的大變活人魔術
and who can forget when I helped Phil with that magic trick

409
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:49,620
我讓他把我變沒了
and let him make me disappear.

410
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:50,660
你沒在那個相片里
You're not in that picture.

411
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:52,400
這說明我幫忙很到位
That's how good I am at helping out.

412
00:13:52,620 --> 00:13:53,980
現在我們來看看
Now let's take a look at some pictures

413
00:13:53,980 --> 00:13:55,180
你幫我家人的照片吧
of you helping out my family.

414
00:13:56,180 --> 00:13:57,660
小卡 我有嘗試寫信
Cam, I tried to write the letter.

415
00:13:57,673 --> 00:14:00,223
我真的有 但她觸犯了法律
I -- I really did, but she broke the law,

416
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,600
她得到了公平的判決
and she got a fair sentence.

417
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,520
她不應該提前出獄
She did not deserve to get out early.

418
00:14:03,723 --> 00:14:05,693
我真的撒不下這個謊
I-I couldn't bring myself to lie about it.

419
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:07,060
少來了你
Oh, give me a break.

420
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:09,040
我曾聽你親口說出
I have heard you say the words,

421
00:14:09,300 --> 00:14:10,420
"頭發燙得真好看 曼尼"
"Nice perm, Manny."

422
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,960
你可以沒下限到那份上
You can get there.

423
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,520
我是法界人士
I am an officer of the law.

424
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:15,680
-我宣過誓 -那我們的誓言呢
- I took an oath. - What about our oath?

425
00:14:15,942 --> 00:14:17,142
要愛彼此 尊重彼此
To love, honor, and --

426
00:14:17,142 --> 00:14:18,462
為彼此的家人說謊
and lie for each other's family.

427
00:14:18,462 --> 00:14:19,482
沒有那句
Oh, that's not part of it.

428
00:14:19,482 --> 00:14:20,502
但暗含在內了
But it's implied.

429
00:14:20,502 --> 00:14:22,162
住口 別吵了
Stop. Stop.

430
00:14:22,780 --> 00:14:23,640
米奇爾說得對
Mitchell's right.

431
00:14:24,260 --> 00:14:26,260
我一整天都在恐嚇他
I spent the day terrorizing him.

432
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:28,040
我是個糟糕的人
I'm a horrible person.

433
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:29,800
我不該這么早出獄
I should still be in jail.

434
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,300
看我偷了什么
Look what I took.

435
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:33,300
那是我的剃須刀嗎
Is that my beard trimmer?

436
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,300
也能剃其他地方的毛
Works on other hairs.

437
00:14:36,780 --> 00:14:37,900
對不起
I'm sorry.

438
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:41,540
我偷 我騙 我操縱他人
I am a thief and a liar and a manipulator.

439
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:44,800
不能放任我這樣的人重返社會
I can't be trusted to rejoin society.

440
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:48,020
別這么說 你會沒事的
Hey, don't say that. You're-you're gonna be fine.

441
00:14:48,140 --> 00:14:49,180
小卡爾怎么辦
What about little Cal?

442
00:14:49,580 --> 00:14:51,100
他在這過得很好
He's doing so good here.

443
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,460
我只會毀了他
I'm just gonna ruin him.

444
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:56,000
我需要監管 需要重新被關起來
I need supervision, to be locked back up.

445
00:14:56,459 --> 00:14:58,039
你們知道我能去哪弄輛皮卡
You guys know where I can get a pickup truck

446
00:14:58,039 --> 00:14:59,029
和一根大鏈子嗎
and a big ol' chain?

447
00:14:59,029 --> 00:15:00,449
我去偷個租碟亭回來
I'm gonna steal me a Redbox.

448
00:15:00,449 --> 00:15:01,999
帕姆 你
Pam, hey, you...

449
00:15:02,229 --> 00:15:04,669
你不必回監獄 明白嗎
You don't have to go back to prison, okay?

450
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:06,540
你可以住在樓上
You can stay upstairs.

451
00:15:07,180 --> 00:15:08,220
你是真心的嗎
Do you mean it?

452
00:15:08,780 --> 00:15:10,060
你們的租客怎么辦
What about your renters?

453
00:15:10,728 --> 00:15:11,869
我們取消
We'll cancel, um,

454
00:15:12,138 --> 00:15:13,638
我們會幫你照顧卡爾
and-and we'll help take care of Cal

455
00:15:13,740 --> 00:15:15,880
直到你重新站穩腳跟 好嗎
until you can get back on your feet, okay?

456
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:17,500
家人是第一位的
Family first.

457
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:19,820
放在相冊里
One for the book.

458
00:15:20,580 --> 00:15:23,900
我去樓上安頓一下 如果可以的話
I'm gonna go get settled upstairs. if it's okay,

459
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:26,880
我泡完澡再下來照顧卡爾
I'll come back down for Cal after my tub.

460
00:15:27,340 --> 00:15:27,920
謝謝你們倆
Thank you both.

461
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:29,940
我不會忘記這份恩情的
I won't forget this.

462
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,440
你真善良
That was so sweet.

463
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,660
我很高興卡爾能留下來
I'm glad Cal gets to stick around.

464
00:15:33,817 --> 00:15:34,557
現在小帕住在這
And now with Pam here,

465
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:36,460
我們去布蘭森時她可以幫忙喂貓
she can feed the cat while we go to Branson.

466
00:15:38,900 --> 00:15:41,520
辛格醫生 您凝膠涂得絕妙
Dr. Singh, that is some exquisite gel work,

467
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:43,220
作為一名準護士
and I say that as a soon-to-be nurse

468
00:15:43,220 --> 00:15:45,240
和用很多發"膠"的人 佩服
and someone who wears a lot of product in his hair.

469
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,200
謝謝
Thank you.

470
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:48,280
海莉 你有沒有服用產前維生素
Haley, have you been taking your prenatal vitamins?

471
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,020
我會確保她從現在起按時服用
I'll make sure she does from now on.

472
00:15:50,300 --> 00:15:50,940
放松點 媽
Calm down, Mom.

473
00:15:51,020 --> 00:15:52,800
每天吃一顆藥這種事我能記住
I can remember to take a pill every day.

474
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:53,460
真能記住嗎[避孕藥]
Can you?

475
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,460
聽到心跳了
There's the heartbeat.

476
00:15:57,585 --> 00:16:00,425
聽起來好快 這正常嗎
Oh, it-it sounds so fast, is everything okay?

477
00:16:00,425 --> 00:16:03,135
很正常 寶寶的心跳聽起來就該是這樣
No, that's good. That's the way a baby's heart should sound.

478
00:16:03,300 --> 00:16:03,900
他說得對
He's right.

479
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,340
聽起來是一個非常健康...
It's the sound of a very healthy --

480
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:06,880
怎么了
What?

481
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:10,280
還有另一個心跳
There's a second heartbeat.

482
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:12,220
寶寶長了兩顆心嗎
A baby with two hearts?

483
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:14,740
我吃那塊大麻布朗尼時不知道自己懷孕了
I didn't know I was pregnant when I ate that brownie!

484
00:16:14,814 --> 00:16:17,154
-我當時不知道 -海莉 深呼吸
- I didn't -- - No, H-Haley, breathe.

485
00:16:17,340 --> 00:16:18,480
你懷了雙胞胎
You're having twins.

486
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:21,260
那不可能 你弄錯了
That's impossible. It's a mistake.

487
00:16:21,260 --> 00:16:23,000
沒有弄錯 我很擅長我的工作
It's not. I'm pretty good at this.

488
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:25,700
她沒弄錯 在這能看到兩個寶寶
She's right. You can see them right here.

489
00:16:25,784 --> 00:16:27,245
我不能生雙胞胎
I can't have twins.

490
00:16:27,274 --> 00:16:29,323
我們準備好迎接一個寶寶 現在加倍了
That's twice as many babies as we were expecting.

491
00:16:29,323 --> 00:16:30,753
是啊 我們會寡不敵眾的
Yeah, they'll outnumber us.

492
00:16:30,753 --> 00:16:31,793
我們家里怎么住得下兩個寶寶
How are they gonna fit in our place?

493
00:16:31,793 --> 00:16:33,463
我的身體怎么裝得下兩個寶寶
How are they gonna fit in my body?

494
00:16:33,463 --> 00:16:34,933
永遠會有一個寶寶是醒的
One is always going to be awake.

495
00:16:34,933 --> 00:16:36,943
我永遠別想睡了 雙胞胎嬰兒車那么寬
I'll never sleep again. And those double-strollers are so wide,

496
00:16:36,943 --> 00:16:39,083
我再也不能進精品店買東西了
I can say goodbye to ever shopping in a boutique.

497
00:16:39,083 --> 00:16:41,003
-海莉 不會有事的 -你又不知道
- Haley, everything's gonna be okay. - You don't know that.

498
00:16:41,003 --> 00:16:42,893
-我知道 -我搞不定這些 媽
- I do! - I'm in way over my head, Mom, I --

499
00:16:42,893 --> 00:16:44,162
但你不是一個人
But you're not alone.

500
00:16:44,162 --> 00:16:45,312
是啊 還有我在
Yeah, I'll be here.

501
00:16:45,312 --> 00:16:47,782
有他在 但我指的是我 有我在
Yeah, he'll be here, but I meant me. I'll be here.

502
00:16:47,782 --> 00:16:49,652
可你最近沒怎么支持我
Yeah, but you kind of haven't been lately.

503
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:50,820
我知道
I know, I know,

504
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,460
我十分抱歉
and I'm very sorry about that,

505
00:16:52,540 --> 00:16:53,840
但正如你很快就會發現的那樣
but as you're about to find out,

506
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:56,480
做媽媽十分復雜
being a mom is very complicated.

507
00:16:57,180 --> 00:16:59,440
幸運的是 會激發很多母性本能
Luckily, there are these instincts that kick in,

508
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:01,200
特別是你的孩子遇到麻煩時
especially when your kid's in trouble.

509
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:04,000
所以假如你應顧不暇了
So if you're ever overwhelmed,

510
00:17:04,411 --> 00:17:06,511
我就在你的肩頭
I am right over your shoulder

511
00:17:06,511 --> 00:17:08,641
騎在蜂鳥的翅膀上
on the wings of a hummingbird.

512
00:17:09,180 --> 00:17:10,780
這下我知道她的大麻布朗尼是從哪來的了
Now I know where she got the brownie.

513
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:13,900
我會在你身后一起騎蜂鳥 鄧太太
And I'll be right behind you on that hummingbird, Mrs. D.

514
00:17:14,100 --> 00:17:16,420
這只蜂鳥只能一個人騎
It's kind of a hummingbird for one.

515
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:20,560
好了 曼尼和他女朋友沒事了
Okay, Manny and his girlfriend are good.

516
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:21,980
煮起來烤起來吧
Let's boil and broil.

517
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:24,540
謝謝你 杰 這就給你做兩根香腸
Thank you, Jay. Two sausages coming up.

518
00:17:24,590 --> 00:17:25,720
兩根 當我是男團的小屁孩嗎
Two? What, am I in a boy band?

519
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:26,680
全做了
Make 'em all.

520
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,680
雪莉具體是怎么說的
So, what did Sherry say exactly?

521
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:31,180
沒說什么 你懂的 主要都是我發話
Not much. I, you know -- I did most of the talking.

522
00:17:31,300 --> 00:17:33,480
希望她現在不會再對曼尼那么頤指氣使
Well, hopefully now she'll stop being so controlling.

523
00:17:33,539 --> 00:17:34,450
是啊
Yeah.

524
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,500
不過其實挺好笑
Funny, though.

525
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:37,720
什么好笑
What is?

526
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,240
只是嘛... 你懂的
Well, it's just that, you know,

527
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:41,180
你很擔心曼尼妻管嚴
you were worried about Manny being pushed around,

528
00:17:41,180 --> 00:17:42,660
但如果你反省一下
and if you think about it,

529
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:44,860
你也整天對我發號施令啊
you've been sort of pushing me around all day.

530
00:17:45,220 --> 00:17:46,360
好笑的地方在哪
What's the funny part?

531
00:17:46,499 --> 00:17:47,528
沒啊 只是...
No, it's just --

532
00:17:47,528 --> 00:17:48,618
這想法從何而來
Where's this coming from?

533
00:17:48,618 --> 00:17:50,098
沒有啊 我自己隨便想到的而已
Nothing, it's just something I thought of.

534
00:17:50,098 --> 00:17:51,988
少來 你才不想事情
No, you don't think of stuff.

535
00:17:51,988 --> 00:17:53,538
-是雪莉說的吧 -才不是呢
- This is Sherry. - No, it isn't.

536
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:54,900
但如果是她說的 這話也不無道理啊
But if it were, she'd have a point.

537
00:17:55,100 --> 00:17:57,040
是嗎 所以你覺得我很愛控制人嗎
Oh, really? So you think I'm very controlling?

538
00:17:57,260 --> 00:17:59,240
那這榮耀交給你 以后醫生你選
Well, you're welcome to choose the doctors,

539
00:17:59,298 --> 00:18:01,538
修繕工你挑 朋友聚會你來安排
pick the handymen, make plans with friends,

540
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:02,760
取消聚會你去說吧
cancel plans with friends.

541
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,740
行行行 我懂了
Okay, okay, I get it.

542
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:05,600
不不不不
No, no, no, no.

543
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:07,360
你的確是應該多管管事了
You do need to take more control.

544
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:09,140
而且擇日不如撞日
Actually, from now on,

545
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:12,220
你的香腸怎么烹調自己來決定吧
you should decide how to cook your own sausage.

546
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,340
行啊 你以為我不會嗎
Fine, you don't think I can do it?

547
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:19,980
咖啡研磨機 我該怎么做她的獨家醬料
Coffee grinder, how do I make Gloria's special sauce?

548
00:18:21,140 --> 00:18:22,140
現在你不出聲了嗎
Now you're quiet?

549
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:24,860
杰
Hey, Jay.

550
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,860
-準備好出發了嗎 -去哪
- You ready to go? - Go where?

551
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,460
歌洛莉亞說你會幫忙我
Gloria said you'd help me put in a skylight

552
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:29,260
給海莉家裝天窗
at Haley's new place.

553
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:31,440
是的 我吩咐她這么說的
Oh, yeah, I empowered her to say that.

554
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:32,760
搬家進行得如何
How's the move going?

555
00:18:32,860 --> 00:18:34,340
很好 非常好
So good. Really good.

556
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:35,580
好得不能再好了
Good, good, good, good.

557
00:18:35,580 --> 00:18:36,600
-那很好啊 -一點都不好
- That's good. - No, it's not.

558
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,160
簡直就是場災難 那屋子太小了
It's a disaster. The place is too small.

559
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:40,160
所有東西都需要修 我努力保持冷靜 但...
Everything needs fixing. I'm trying to stay calm, but...

560
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:43,600
他們的屋頂有個洞啊 杰
There's a hole in the ceiling, Jay --

561
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:45,980
屋頂有洞啊
a hole in the ceiling.

562
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:47,400
雨水會滴到嬰兒床里
Rain is gonna fall on the crib.

563
00:18:47,435 --> 00:18:48,955
萬一... 萬一有只貓頭鷹
What -- What happens if a -- an owl

564
00:18:48,955 --> 00:18:50,794
叼了個松果飛過時松嘴了呢
picks up a-a pinecone and drops it?

565
00:18:50,794 --> 00:18:53,404
-我的孫兒會被松果砸到啊 -別犯傻了
- My grandchild's gonna get hit with a pinecone! - Don't be silly.

566
00:18:53,404 --> 00:18:55,714
貓頭鷹怎么會叼著松果呢
What would an owl be doing with a pinecone?

567
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:57,980
最多也就是叼著老鼠或囊地鼠寶寶罷了
At the most, it would be a mouse or a baby gopher.

568
00:18:58,320 --> 00:18:59,920
迪蘭感覺開始靠譜點了
Dylan seems like he's getting his life together,

569
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,780
但他最多也就算是個未知數
but he's still a wild card at best.

570
00:19:01,980 --> 00:19:03,440
我完全懂你現在的感受
I know exactly how you feel.

571
00:19:03,784 --> 00:19:05,823
我想你是真懂 當年你也覺得我是未知數吧
I guess you do. I was your wild card, huh?

572
00:19:05,823 --> 00:19:07,164
我當年沒多少信心
I didn't have a lot of faith.

573
00:19:07,340 --> 00:19:09,120
你那時候耳邊還吊著羽毛之類的吧
Didn't you have feathers hanging off your ear?

574
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:11,040
-是阻擋惡夢的捕夢網 -那就是我的惡夢
- It was a dream catcher. - It was my nightmare.

575
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:12,940
我想我懂你要說的意思了
I think I see what you're saying.

576
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:16,300
我能變得這么棒 沒道理他不行
If I can become awesome, so can Dylan.

577
00:19:16,493 --> 00:19:17,604
我才不是這個意思
That's not what I'm saying.

578
00:19:17,840 --> 00:19:19,180
鬼知道之后會變怎么樣啊
Who the hell knows what's gonna happen?

579
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:20,480
讓我告訴你人生是怎么回事
Let me tell you something about life.

580
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:23,580
我們都有覺得自己能掌控人生的錯覺
We all have this illusion that we're in control.

581
00:19:24,252 --> 00:19:25,652
我想去打職業橄欖球
I wanted to play pro football,

582
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:26,820
結果被人弄得膝蓋不行了
some guy takes my knee out.

583
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:27,980
我從校園畢業
I graduate from school,

584
00:19:28,012 --> 00:19:29,932
打算騎著摩托穿越全國
I'm gonna drive my motorcycle across the country,

585
00:19:29,932 --> 00:19:31,982
結果被抽簽到去當兵
and some suit pulls my draft number.

586
00:19:31,982 --> 00:19:34,582
我努力工作讓我女兒能讀完大學
I worked my ass off to send my daughter to college,

587
00:19:34,620 --> 00:19:35,980
一個玩雜耍的家伙把她肚子搞大
some juggler knocks her up.

588
00:19:35,980 --> 00:19:37,760
大人 再次跟您道歉
Again, sir, I'm very sorry about that.

589
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:39,800
我投入無數年心血建立起我的生意
I put in the years, I build my business

590
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:41,000
好讓自己不用臣服于其他人
so I don't have to answer to anyone,

591
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,700
可現在我還是得歷經磨難
and I still have to jump through hoops

592
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:43,840
才能換得香腸吃
to get a damn sausage.

593
00:19:44,201 --> 00:19:45,761
最后這部分我聽不懂
You lost me there at that last part.

594
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:48,760
聽我說 我的意思是
Look, all I'm saying is things

595
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:50,820
計劃永遠趕不上變化
are always gonna change,

596
00:19:50,820 --> 00:19:52,800
所以你得關關難過關關過
and you have to deal with it.

597
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:55,740
但好消息是 五年后的這時候
But the good news is, five years from now

598
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:57,360
當你跟自己的孫兒玩的時候
while you're playing with your grandkid,

599
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:59,400
今天早就拋到九霄云外了
you won't even remember today.

600
00:20:01,410 --> 00:20:02,880
我還沒有用這個角度想過
I hadn't thought about it like that.

601
00:20:03,470 --> 00:20:04,511
謝謝你 杰
Thanks, Jay.

602
00:20:08,540 --> 00:20:11,580
海莉與迪蘭要搬回來跟我們住了
Huh. Haley and Dylan are gonna have to move back in with us.

603
00:20:12,149 --> 00:20:14,439
沒關系 我受得了
That's okay. I can handle that.

604
00:20:17,100 --> 00:20:18,460
她懷了雙胞胎
She's having twins.

605
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:20,740
給你來根香腸吧
Let's get you a sausage.

606
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:30,280
謝謝
Thank you.

607
00:20:33,488 --> 00:20:34,628
那是一箱衣服
It was a box of cloth.

608
00:20:34,660 --> 00:20:37,240
是小帕請她母親給她寄來
Pam asked her mom to ship to her,

609
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,600
三天前寄出的
three days ago.

610
00:20:40,407 --> 00:20:42,727
你演了一出崩潰好戲好留在這里
You faked that break down so you could stay here.

611
00:20:42,800 --> 00:20:43,920
干得漂亮 律師
Well done, counselor.

612
00:20:44,060 --> 00:20:46,060
你看 這就是為什么我寫不出那封信
See! This is why I couldn't write that letter for you.

613
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:49,300
你對你坑蒙拐騙的事情毫無悔意
You have no remorse for your lying, stealing ways.

614
00:20:49,427 --> 00:20:50,687
但我盯上你了
But I'm on to you.

615
00:20:50,687 --> 00:20:52,687
我會讓你付出代價
And I'm going to make you pay.

616
00:20:53,100 --> 00:20:53,880
你省省吧
No, you ain't.

617
00:20:54,507 --> 00:20:55,976
就你這小身板
You're tiny.

618
00:20:55,976 --> 00:20:57,636
那是我們的臺燈嗎
Hey, hey! Are those our lamps?

619
00:20:57,940 --> 00:20:58,320
小帕
Pam!
